#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "Anotacije"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Point, region, line and text annotations with reusable classes, cell "
"counting, HPF fields and measurements; GeoJSON (QuPath) import and export, "
"ASAP and Aperio ImageScope XML import."
msgstr ""
"Anotacije s točkami, območji, črtami in besedilom ter razredi za večkratno "
"uporabo, štetje celic, polja HPF in meritve; uvoz in izvoz GeoJSON (QuPath) "
"ter uvoz XML iz programov ASAP in Aperio ImageScope."

