#: src/db/mod.rs:159
msgid ""
"New database. If you annotated with eov before 1.0, those annotations are in "
"annotations.db in eov's old settings folder (~/.config/eov on Linux, ~/"
"Library/Application Support/eov on macOS, %APPDATA%\\eov on Windows): bring "
"them in with Merge… above."
msgstr ""
"Nova zbirka podatkov. Če ste anotacije ustvarjali s programom eov pred "
"različico 1.0, so v datoteki annotations.db v stari mapi z nastavitvami "
"programa eov (~/.config/eov v Linuxu, ~/Library/Application Support/eov v "
"sistemu macOS, %APPDATA%\\eov v sistemu Windows): prenesite jih z gumbom "
"Združi … zgoraj."

