#. Translators: {} lists what is lost, such as "the heads of 2 arrows (written
#. as lines) and the text of 1 text label (written as points)".
#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:919
msgid ""
"DICOM bulk annotations cannot hold {}: other viewers do not see them, but "
"eov reads them back from its private attributes."
msgstr ""
"Množične anotacije DICOM ne morejo vsebovati naslednjega: {}. Drugi "
"pregledovalniki tega ne vidijo, eov pa to obnovi iz svojih zasebnih "
"atributov."

#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:924
msgid ""
"Each layer, class and kind of shape is a group labelled with its class (or "
"its layer). Authors, comments, properties and times are not exported (eov "
"JSON keeps everything)."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka kombinacija plasti, razreda in vrste oblike je skupina, označena s "
"svojim razredom (ali plastjo). Avtorji, komentarji, lastnosti in časovni "
"žigi se ne izvozijo (eov JSON ohrani vse)."

#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:928
msgid ""
"{n} annotation with too few points or unusable coordinates was left out."
msgid_plural ""
"{n} annotations with too few points or unusable coordinates were left out."
msgstr[0] ""
"{n} anotacija s premalo točkami ali neuporabnimi koordinatami je bila "
"izpuščena."
msgstr[1] ""
"{n} anotaciji s premalo točkami ali neuporabnimi koordinatami sta bili "
"izpuščeni."
msgstr[2] ""
"{n} anotacije s premalo točkami ali neuporabnimi koordinatami so bile "
"izpuščene."
msgstr[3] ""
"{n} anotacij s premalo točkami ali neuporabnimi koordinatami je bilo "
"izpuščenih."

